# TITAN V4 checker donor hardening patch H3 — precise expression/reflection alias closure
#
# Apply after H 89ac8ed12b53d1d41649732e8e349f3ce532b69b.
# SUPERSEDES/RETIRES H2 4219a4042805c7f83f243b8e8812f59d0d3fd470.
# Donor only. No carrier/ref/workflow/merge authority.
#
# H3 closes protected identity preserved by identity-returning syntax while NOT
# treating arbitrary uses such as `x = self.compute()` as aliases of self.
# Supported provenance forms are deliberately finite and auditable:
#   - direct protected name / self.features;
#   - if-expressions and and/or (which return an operand);
#   - named expressions;
#   - tuple/list/dict literal subscripts (constant index/key exactly, otherwise
#     conservatively union literal members that could be returned);
#   - exact getattr/object.__getattribute__(root, "features") for Features object;
#   - module globals()/locals() exact protected-class lookup via []/.get/__getitem__.
# Dynamic/ambiguous protected provenance fails closed only when it is bound or
# used as a protected mutation/proxy receiver.

